     "title": "The King Who Was Grateful",
     "sub": "The Story of Prophet Sulaiman (AS)"
    }
   ],
   "scene": "photos"
  },
  {
   "title": "The Son of Dawud (AS)",
   "photos": [
    "assets/gen/c01a.jpg",
    "assets/gen/c01b.jpg",
    "assets/gen/c01c.jpg"
   ],
   "photo_at": [
    0,
    2,
    3
   ],
   "cards": [
    {
     "line": 1,
     "q": "38:30",
     "w": [
      1,
      7
     ],
     "en": "And to David We gave Solomon. An excellent servant, indeed he was one repeatedly turning back [to Allah]"
    },
    {
     "line": 4,
     "q": "21:79",
     "w": [
      1,
      6
     ],
     "en": "And We gave understanding of the case to Solomon, and to each [of them] We gave judgement and knowledge"
    }
   ],
   "scene": "photos"
  },
  {
   "title": "A Kingdom Like No Other",
   "photos": [
    "assets/gen/c02a.jpg",
    "assets/gen/c02b.jpg",
    "assets/gen/c02c.jpg",
    "assets/gen/c02d.jpg"
   ],
   "photo_at": [
    0,
    3,
    5,
    6
   ],
   "cards": [
    {
     "line": 1,
     "q": "38:35",
     "w": [
      1,
      15
     ],
     "en": "My Lord, forgive me and grant me a kingdom such as will not belong to anyone after me. Indeed, You are the Bestower"
    },
    {
     "line": 3,
     "q": "38:36",
     "w": [
      1,
      8
     ],
     "en": "So We subjected to him the wind blowing by his command, gently, wherever he directed"
    },
    {
     "line": 6,
     "q": "34:13",
     "w": [
      12,
      19
     ],
     "en": "Work, O family of David, in gratitude.\" And few of My servants are grateful"
    }
   ],
   "scene": "photos"
  },
  {
   "title": "The Language of the Birds",
   "photos": [
    "assets/gen/c03a.jpg",
    "assets/gen/c03b.jpg"
   ],
   "photo_at": [
    0,
    3
   ],
   "cards": [
    {
     "line": 0,
     "q": "27:16",
     "w": [
      4,
      18
     ],
     "en": "O people, we have been taught the language of birds, and we have been given from all things. Indeed, this is evident bounty"
    },
    {
     "line": 3,
     "q": "27:17",
     "w": [
      1,
      9
     ],
     "en": "And gathered for Solomon were his soldiers of the jinn and men and birds, and they were [marching] in rows"
    }
   ],
   "scene": "photos"
  },
  {
   "title": "The Valley of the Ants",
   "photos": [
    "assets/gen/c04a.jpg",
    "assets/gen/c04b.jpg",
    "assets/gen/c04c.jpg",
    "assets/gen/c04d.jpg"
   ],
   "photo_at": [
    0,
    2,
    4,
    6
   ],
   "cards": [
    {
     "line": 1,
     "q": "27:18",
     "w": [
      7,
      19
     ],
     "en": "O ants, enter your dwellings that you not be crushed by Solomon and his soldiers while they perceive not"
    },
    {
     "line": 4,
     "q": "27:19",
     "w": [
      1,
      4
     ],
     "en": "So [Solomon] smiled, amused at her speech"
    },
    {
     "line": 6,
     "q": "27:19",
     "w": [
      6,
      24
     ],
     "en": "My Lord, enable me to be grateful for Your favor which You have bestowed upon me and upon my parents and to do righteousness of which You approve. And admit me by Your mercy into [the ranks of] Your righteous servants"
    }
   ],
   "scene": "photos"
  },
  {
   "title": "The Missing Hoopoe",
   "photos": [
    "assets/gen/c05a.jpg",
    "assets/gen/c05b.jpg",
    "assets/gen/c05c.jpg"
   ],
   "photo_at": [
    0,
    2,
    3
   ],
   "cards": [
    {
     "line": 0,
     "q": "27:20",
     "w": [
      1,
      11
     ],
     "en": "Why do I not see the hoopoe - or is he among the absent"
    },
    {
     "line": 3,
     "q": "27:22",
     "w": [
      5,
      14
     ],
     "en": "I have encompassed [in knowledge] that which you have not encompassed, and I have come to you from Sheba with certain news"
    }
   ],
   "scene": "photos"
  },
  {
   "title": "The Queen of Sheba",
   "photos": [
    "assets/gen/c06a.jpg",
    "assets/gen/c06b.jpg",
    "assets/gen/c06c.jpg",
    "assets/gen/c06d.jpg"
   ],
   "photo_at": [
    0,
    1,
    2,
    5
   ],
   "cards": [
    {
     "line": 0,
     "q": "27:23",
     "w": [
      1,
      11
     ],
     "en": "Indeed, I found [there] a woman ruling them, and she has been given of all things, and she has a great throne"
    },
    {
     "line": 2,
     "q": "27:24",
     "w": [
      1,
      7
     ],
     "en": "I found her and her people prostrating to the sun instead of Allah"
    },
    {
     "line": 4,
     "q": "27:27",
     "w": [
      1,
      7
     ],
     "en": "We will see whether you were truthful or were of the liars"
    }
   ],
   "scene": "photos"
  },
  {
   "title": "The Letter",
   "photos": [
    "assets/gen/c07a.jpg",
    "assets/gen/c07b.jpg",
    "assets/gen/c07c.jpg"
   ],
   "photo_at": [
    0,
    2,
    5
   ],
   "cards": [
    {
     "line": 0,
     "q": "27:28",
     "w": [
      1,
      11
     ],
     "en": "Take this letter of mine and deliver it to them. Then leave them and see what [answer] they will return"
    },
    {
     "line": 2,
     "q": "27:30",
     "w": [
      1,
      8
     ],
     "en": "Indeed, it is from Solomon, and indeed, it reads: 'In the name of Allah, the Entirely Merciful, the Especially Merciful"
    },
    {
     "line": 4,
     "q": "27:34",
     "w": [
      1,
      13
     ],
     "en": "Indeed kings - when they enter a city, they ruin it"
    }
   ],
   "scene": "photos"
  },
  {
   "title": "The Gift",
   "photos": [
    "assets/gen/c08a.jpg",
    "assets/gen/c08b.jpg",
    "assets/gen/c08c.jpg"
   ],
   "photo_at": [
    0,
    2,
    3
   ],
   "cards": [
    {
     "line": 1,
     "q": "27:36",
     "w": [
      5,
      16
     ],
     "en": "Do you provide me with wealth? But what Allah has given me is better than what He has given you. Rather, it is you who rejoice in your gift"
    }
   ],
   "scene": "photos"
  },
  {
   "title": "Before an Eye Could Blink",
   "photos": [
    "assets/gen/c09a.jpg",
    "assets/gen/c09b.jpg",
    "assets/gen/c09c.jpg"
   ],
   "photo_at": [
    0,
    5,
    7
   ],
   "cards": [
    {
     "line": 1,
     "q": "27:39",
     "w": [
      1,
      16
     ],
     "en": "I will bring it to you before you rise from your place"
    },
    {
     "line": 3,
     "q": "27:40",
     "w": [
      1,
      14
     ],
     "en": "I will bring it to you before your glance returns to you"
    },
    {
     "line": 7,
     "q": "27:40",
     "w": [
      20,
      38
     ],
     "en": "This is from the favor of my Lord to test me whether I will be grateful or ungrateful. And whoever is grateful - his gratitude is only for [the benefit of] himself. And whoever is ungrateful - then indeed, my Lord is Free of need and Generous"
    }
   ],
   "scene": "photos"
  },
  {
   "title": "The Floor of Glass",
   "photos": [
    "assets/gen/c10a.jpg",
    "assets/gen/c10b.jpg",
    "assets/gen/c10c.jpg",
    "assets/gen/c10d.jpg"
   ],
   "photo_at": [
    0,
    1,
    2,
    4
   ],
   "cards": [
    {
     "line": 0,
     "q": "27:42",
     "w": [
      1,
      8
     ],
     "en": "Is your throne like this?\" She said, \"[It is] as though it was it"
    },
    {
     "line": 2,
     "q": "27:44",
     "w": [
      12,
      17
     ],
     "en": "Indeed, it is a palace [whose floor is] made smooth with glass"
    },
    {
     "line": 5,
     "q": "27:44",
     "w": [
      18,
      28
     ],
     "en": "My Lord, indeed I have wronged myself, and I submit with Solomon to Allah, Lord of the worlds"
    }
   ],
   "scene": "photos"
  },
  {
   "title": "The Staff",
   "photos": [
    "assets/gen/c11a.jpg",
    "assets/gen/c11b.jpg",
    "assets/gen/c11c.jpg"
   ],
   "photo_at": [
